[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4171203229","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118076#issuecomment-4171203229","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118076","id":4171203229,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc74n4Kd","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-01T16:13:28Z","updated_at":"2026-04-01T16:13:28Z","body":"@ArchercatNEO requesting review from you as well as @stuartcarnie if you want to review this. Feel free to use the followup PR #118079 for testing, as it uses this PR's signal.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4171203229/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4179012951","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118076#issuecomment-4179012951","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118076","id":4179012951,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75Fq1X","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-02T16:25:39Z","updated_at":"2026-04-02T16:26:32Z","body":"Oh, I completely forgot about #116134! Thanks, indeed it would be better to detect changes of luminance values by simply always firing the event when we get a `ColorProfileMessage`.\r\n\r\nAnd yes, we should also fire the event any time that `window_get_hdr_output_enabled` has changed.\r\n\r\nBut on this subject... Is it possible for Wayland (or any other platform) to get into a state where `RenderingContextDriver::window_get_hdr_output_enabled(...)` would return `true` when the window is actually rendering in SDR mode? (For example, if the attempt to change to HDR mode has failed.)\r\n\r\nAs far as I can tell, `_window_update_hdr_state(...)` or equivalent on other platforms is the only place that `window_set_hdr_output_enabled` is modified, but it must always be kept in sync with the actual mode...","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4179012951/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4179072741","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118076#issuecomment-4179072741","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118076","id":4179072741,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75F5bl","user":{"login":"ArchercatNEO","id":108980279,"node_id":"U_kgDOBn7oNw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108980279?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO","html_url":"https://github.com/ArchercatNEO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-02T16:36:54Z","updated_at":"2026-04-02T16:36:54Z","body":"If enabling HDR fails in the vulkan driver, then yes `RenderingContextDriverVulkan::window_get_hdr_output_enabled` would keep returning true unless the DisplayServer (currently only wayland) re-disabled HDR rendering for that window (which it currently doesn't do).\r\n\r\nUnless Android either guarantees that the HDR formats we want are supported in some other way, it should probably also check to make sure enabling HDR didn't fail. I read enough to know our minimum version of D3D12 is required to support our HDR formats so Windows is not at risk but I don't know enough about metal to know if enabling HDR could fail.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4179072741/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4179154166","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118076#issuecomment-4179154166","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118076","id":4179154166,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75GNT2","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-02T16:52:22Z","updated_at":"2026-04-02T16:53:56Z","body":"> Happy with the changes to Wayland code!\r\n\r\nThanks!\r\n\r\n> If enabling HDR fails in the vulkan driver, then yes `RenderingContextDriverVulkan::window_get_hdr_output_enabled` would keep returning true unless the DisplayServer (currently only wayland) re-disabled HDR rendering for that window (which it currently doesn't do).\r\n\r\nThis was a bug. Do the changes that I pushed fix this bug?\r\n\r\n> Out of curiosity, will this PR be updated to also include Android?\r\n\r\nNo, Android has outstanding issues and probably won't be merged for 4.7, but hopefully this PR can be merged for 4.7.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4179154166/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4179185512","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118076#issuecomment-4179185512","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118076","id":4179185512,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75GU9o","user":{"login":"ArchercatNEO","id":108980279,"node_id":"U_kgDOBn7oNw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108980279?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO","html_url":"https://github.com/ArchercatNEO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-02T16:58:10Z","updated_at":"2026-04-02T16:58:10Z","body":"> > If enabling HDR fails in the vulkan driver, then yes `RenderingContextDriverVulkan::window_get_hdr_output_enabled` would keep returning true unless the DisplayServer (currently only wayland) re-disabled HDR rendering for that window (which it currently doesn't do).\r\n> \r\n> This was a bug. Do the changes that I pushed fix this bug?\r\n\r\nI believe so, if for whatever reason the rendering context is using `NONLINEAR_SRGB` we can be sure it's rendering in SDR and if it's in `EXT_LINEAR` we can be sure it's in HDR. This should disable hdr within the rendering context.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4179185512/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4179240159","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118076#issuecomment-4179240159","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118076","id":4179240159,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75GiTf","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-02T17:08:46Z","updated_at":"2026-04-02T17:08:46Z","body":"> I checked the Apple (embedded and macOS) changes and they look good to me. This is a great addition.\r\n\r\n@stuartcarnie there was an issue in Wayland that we just discussed where `rendering_context->window_set_hdr_output_enabled(...)` was called in the DisplayServer's `update_hdr_state` function, but later when the surface was attempted to be made into an HDR surface it could fail. And if it failed, `rendering_context->window_set_hdr_output_enabled(...)` was never called and would be left in a bad state where it Godot would report `hdr_output_enabled == true` when in fact the surface was an SDR surface.\r\n\r\nI've updated this PR to address that issue for Wayland by calling `rendering_context->window_set_hdr_output_enabled(...)` any time changing the surface has failed.\r\n\r\nDoes this sort of problem exist on any of the Apple platforms?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4179240159/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4180239897","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118076#issuecomment-4180239897","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118076","id":4180239897,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75KWYZ","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-02T20:13:46Z","updated_at":"2026-04-02T20:13:46Z","body":"> but later when the surface was attempted to be made into an HDR surface it could fail.\r\n\r\nNo, we should be fine. The surface on Apple already exists (`CA::MetalLayer`), we just set a boolean property that we want it to present EDR content.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4180239897/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4184255313","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118076#issuecomment-4184255313","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118076","id":4184255313,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75ZqtR","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-03T16:55:03Z","updated_at":"2026-04-03T16:55:03Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4184255313/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]